_outputs:1, number_of_inputs:1, author_name_latex:"ben.is.located@gmail.com", number_of_feeds:1, notes_latex:"", latex:"Indefinite integral of both sides of Eq.~\ref{eq:#2} over $#1$; yields Eq.~\ref{eq:#3}."}}, {id:"111137", properties:{name_latex:"indefinite integrate LHS over", assumptions_latex:"multi-variable calculus", number_of_outputs:1, number_of_inputs:1, author_name_latex:"ben.is.located@gmail.com", number_of_feeds:1, notes_latex:"", latex:"Indefinite integral of LHS of Eq.~\ref{eq:#2} over $#1$; yields Eq.~\ref{eq:#3}."}}, {id:"111132", properties:{name_latex:"indefinite integrate RHS over", assumptions_latex:"multi-variable calculus", number_of_outputs:1, number_of_inputs:1, author_name_latex:"ben.is.located@gmail.com", number_of_feeds:1, notes_latex:"", latex:"Indefinite integral of RHS of Eq.~\ref{eq:#2} over $#1$; yields Eq.~\ref{eq:#3}."}}, {id:"111608", properties:{name_latex:"indefinite integration", assumptions_latex:"multi-variable calculus", number_of_outputs:1, number_of_inputs:1, author_name_latex:"ben.is.located@gmail.com", number_of_feeds:0, notes_latex:"", latex:"Indefinite integral of both sides of Eq.~\ref{eq:#1}; yields Eq.~\ref{eq:#2}."}}, {id:"111408", properties:{name_latex:"integrate", assumptions_latex:"multi-variable calculus", number_of_outputs:1, number_of_inputs:1, author_name_latex:"ben.is.located@gmail.com", number_of_feeds:0, notes_latex:"not clear how to specify limits for an arbitrary number of integrals", latex:"Integrate Eq.~ref{eq:#1}; yields Eq.~ref{eq:#2}."}}, {id:"111937", properties:{name_latex:"integrate over from to", assumptions_latex:"multi-variable calculus", number_of_outputs:1, number_of_inputs:1, author_name_latex:"ben.is.located@gmail.com", number_of_feeds:3, notes_latex:"", latex:"Integrate Eq.~\ref{eq:#4} over $#1$ from lower limit $#2$ to upper limit $#3$; yields Eq.~\ref{eq:#5}."}}, {id:"111721", properties:{name_latex:"make expr power", assumptions_latex:"", number_of_outputs:1, number_of_inputs:1, author_name_latex:"ben.is.located@gmail.com", number_of_feeds:1, notes_latex:"", latex:"Make Eq.~\ref{eq:#2} the power of $#1$; yields Eq.~\ref{eq:#3}."}}] AS row
