lds Eq.~\ref{eq:#2}."}}, {id:"111198", properties:{name_latex:"select real parts", assumptions_latex:"complex values", number_of_outputs:1, number_of_inputs:1, author_name_latex:"ben.is.located@gmail.com", number_of_feeds:0, notes_latex:"", latex:"Select real parts of Eq.~\ref{eq:#1}; yields Eq.~\ref{eq:#2}."}}, {id:"111552", properties:{name_latex:"separate three vector components", assumptions_latex:"", number_of_outputs:3, number_of_inputs:1, author_name_latex:"ben.is.located@gmail.com", number_of_feeds:0, notes_latex:"", latex:"Separate three vector components in Eq.~\ref{eq:#1}; yields Eq.~\ref{eq:#2} and Eq.~\ref{eq:#3} and Eq.~\ref{eq:#4}."}}, {id:"111270", properties:{name_latex:"separate two vector components", assumptions_latex:"", number_of_outputs:2, number_of_inputs:1, author_name_latex:"ben.is.located@gmail.com", number_of_feeds:0, notes_latex:"", latex:"Separate two vector components in Eq.~\ref{eq:#1}; yields Eq.~\ref{eq:#2} and Eq.~\ref{eq:#3}"}}, {id:"111295", properties:{name_latex:"separate vector into two trigonometric ratios", assumptions_latex:"", number_of_outputs:2, number_of_inputs:1, author_name_latex:"ben.is.located@gmail.com", number_of_feeds:1, notes_latex:"geometry argument in 2D", latex:"Separate vector in Eq.~\ref{eq:#2} into components related by angle $#1$; yields Eq.~\ref{eq:#3} and Eq.~\ref{eq:#4}."}}, {id:"111457", properties:{name_latex:"simplify", assumptions_latex:"", number_of_outputs:1, number_of_inputs:1, author_name_latex:"ben.is.located@gmail.com", number_of_feeds:0, notes_latex:"", latex:"Simplify Eq.~\ref{eq:#1}; yields Eq.~\ref{eq:#2}."}}, {id:"111543", properties:{name_latex:"solve for X", assumptions_latex:"", number_of_outputs:1, number_of_inputs:1, author_name_latex:"ben.is.located@gmail.com", number_of_feeds:1, notes_latex:"", latex:"Solve Eq.~\ref{eq:#2} for $#1$; yields Eq.~\ref{eq:#3}."}}, {id:"111524", properties:{name_latex:"square root both sides", assumptions_latex:"", number_of_outputs:2, number_of_inputs